# Design and planning documents dropped into the project folder while working.
# Ignored by extension rather than by filename because the failure mode is a
# file nobody remembered to list: "Website flow 2.pdf" sat untracked in the repo
# root, one `git add .` away from a public commit, and it is the same category as
# BUILD-PLAN.md. No PDF has ever belonged in this repository's tracked files, so
# the broad pattern costs nothing and does not depend on anyone naming the next one.
*.pdf

# line-drawing prototypes and the photos they were measured on: working
# material for S12, not part of the app
prototypes/
test-photos/
